meta {
  name: Create Radiology Test List
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-test-lists
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "B2B Corporate",
    "copyPriceFrom": "MAXIMUM",
    "priceType": "PERCENTAGE",
    "copyPercentage": 20
  }
}

script:post-response {
  const data = res.getBody() && res.getBody().data;
  if (data && data.id) bru.setEnvVar("branchRadiologyTestListId", data.id);
}

tests {
  test("201 Created", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(201);
  });
}

docs {
  🔒 **RBAC:** requires `branch_admin:lab_test_list__add_lab_test_list` — enforced
  by `PermissionGuard`; admins bypass, so `{{businessAccessToken}}` succeeds. (The
  radiology list module reuses the lab test-list permission keys — there are no
  radiology-specific ones.)

  Create a new (non-default) branch **Radiology Test List**. Business JWT. Captures
  `branchRadiologyTestListId`. Seeded by cloning the default (Walk-in) list's
  tests; each row's `listPrice` is computed from `copyPriceFrom` per `priceType`:
  - PERCENTAGE → source column × `copyPercentage` ÷ 100 (percentage required, 0–100)
  - CUSTOMIZED → source column copied as-is (percentage ignored)

  Fields:
  - `name` (**required**, ≤120) — unique per branch among active lists (409
    `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_LIST_NAME_CONFLICT` on clash).
  - `copyPriceFrom` (**required**) — MSRP | MAXIMUM | MINIMUM | ORIGINAL | FRANCHISE.
  - `priceType` (**required**) — PERCENTAGE | CUSTOMIZED.
  - `copyPercentage` (0–100) — **required only when** `priceType = PERCENTAGE`.

  400 `ACTIVE_BRANCH_REQUIRED` if the JWT has no active branch.
}
